 "drug_rule": "Fluoxetine inhibits CYP2D6, reducing clearance of CYP2D6 substrates (e.g., methylene blue). Additionally, fluoxetine inhibits CYP2C19, further reducing clearance of methylene blue. In a patient with normal hepatic and renal function, this interaction can lead to a 2- to 3-fold increase in methylene blue exposure, potentially causing toxicity.",
